    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"71ac32f871483d2b\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 3. Target vs. Each Numeric Feature\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"269c2ae338d7f209\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"**Understanding the p-value.** Each regression line reports a **p-value** whose *null hypothesis* is that the slope is **zero** (no linear relationship between the feature and Mental Health Score). A small **p-value (≤ 0.05)** means the slope is **significantly different from zero** — i.e. the feature is linearly associated with the target.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 5,\n",
    "   \"id\": \"c6a81019df4991b9\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-07-27T17:14:18.888194Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-07-27T17:14:18.467518Z\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"execution\": {\n",
    "     \"iopub.execute_input\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:29.715451Z\",\n",
    "     \"iopub.status.busy\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:29.715353Z\",\n",
    "     \"iopub.status.idle\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:30.127827Z\",\n",
    "     \"shell.execute_reply\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:30.127447Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"data\": {\n",
    "      \"image/png\": \"\",\n",
    "      \"text/plain\": [\n",
    "       \"<Figure size 1760x990 with 6 Axes>\"\n",
    "      ]\n",
    "     },\n",
    "     \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"display_data\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"feature_cols = [c for c in NUMERIC_COLS if c != TARGET]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"stress_palette_list = sns.color_palette('YlOrRd', 4)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(16, 9))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"axes = axes.flatten()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for i, col in enumerate(feature_cols):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax = axes[i]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for j, lvl in enumerate(STRESS_ORDER):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        mask = df['Stress_Level'] == lvl\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        ax.scatter(df.loc[mask, col], df.loc[mask, TARGET],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                   s=6, alpha=0.35, color=stress_palette_list[j], label=lvl)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # regression line\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    m, b, r, p, _ = stats.linregress(df[col], df[TARGET])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    x_range = np.linspace(df[col].min(), df[col].max(), 200)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax.plot(x_range, m * x_range + b, 'k--', lw=1.5)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax.set_xlabel(col.replace('_', ' '))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax.set_ylabel('Mental Health Score')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    p_str = f'{p:.2e}' if p < 0.001 else f'{p:.4f}'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax.set_title(f'r={r:.3f}, p={p_str}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if i == 0:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        ax.legend(fontsize=7, title='Stress Level', title_fontsize=7)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"fig.suptitle('Mental Health Score vs Numeric Features', fontsize=14, y=1.01)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"plt.tight_layout()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"plt.show()\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"634df6aea6661096\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 4. Categorical Feature vs. Target (ANOVA)\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"a542efad8d629d03\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"**Understanding the p-value.** ANOVA's *null hypothesis* is that **all group means are equal**. The **p-value** is the probability of seeing group differences this large by chance if the means were actually identical.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **p ≤ 0.05** → at least one category's mean **differs significantly**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **p > 0.05** → no significant difference between the groups\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 6,\n",
    "   \"id\": \"55ba592ef7fe8cf\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-07-27T17:14:19.889461Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-07-27T17:14:18.895140Z\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"execution\": {\n",
    "     \"iopub.execute_input\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:30.130222Z\",\n",
    "     \"iopub.status.busy\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:30.130136Z\",\n",
    "     \"iopub.status.idle\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:31.103784Z\",\n",
    "     \"shell.execute_reply\": \"2026-07-27T19:38:31.103501Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"data\": {\n",
    "      \"image/png\": \"\",\n",
    "      \"text/plain\": [\n",
